    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 226.06399536132812,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        85
      ],
      "characterBudget": 52,
      "text": "Then sway your hips from side to side.",
      "id": 54,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 229.99993896484375
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 231.343994140625,
      "overBudget": true,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        86
      ],
      "characterBudget": 34,
      "text": "Use your waist, where your hands rest, as the pivot.",
      "id": 55,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 233.828807170017
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 233.85678664072316,
      "overBudget": true,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        86
      ],
      "characterBudget": 13,
      "text": "Move back and forth.",
      "id": 56,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 234.86399841308594
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 235.10400390625,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        87,
        88
      ],
      "characterBudget": 107,
      "text": "When arching your back, relax a little and rest your buttocks on the bed, then continue.",
      "id": 57,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        74
      ],
      "end": 242.70399475097656
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 242.70399475097656,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        89,
        90
      ],
      "characterBudget": 85,
      "text": "After the cross, move both hands up to this spot, where your fingertips are.",
      "id": 58,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 248.80399658203126
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 249.58399963378906,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        91
      ],
      "characterBudget": 32,
      "text": "Then rock side to side in the middle.",
      "id": 59,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 251.92399169921876
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 253.10400390625,
      "overBudget": true,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        92
      ],
      "characterBudget": 22,
      "text": "Then rock side to side below.",
      "id": 60,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 254.72399475097657
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 255.82400512695312,
      "overBudget": true,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        93
      ],
      "characterBudget": 17,
      "text": "Then rock side to side above.",
      "id": 61,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 257.12400390625
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 257.5039978027344,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        94,
        95,
        96
      ],
      "characterBudget": 50,
      "text": "The iliac crest sits around the waist,",
      "id": 62,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 260.9028951955396
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 260.95788759250576,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        94,
        95,
        96
      ],
      "characterBudget": 93,
      "text": "near the lumbar vertebrae that are prone to problems—roughly L2 to L5.",
      "id": 63,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 267.7439880371094
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 267.90399169921875,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        97
      ],
      "characterBudget": 79,
      "text": "Rocking side to side helps loosen the muscles and ligaments on either side of the spine.",
      "id": 64,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        70
      ],
      "end": 273.66400146484375
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 273.9840087890625,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        98,
        99
      ],
      "characterBudget": 45,
      "text": "Once loosened, the stuck joint surfaces can open up,",
      "id": 65,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 277.24504775010143
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 277.28080392940603,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        98,
        99
      ],
      "characterBudget": 38,
      "text": "and the bones can gradually return to place.",
      "id": 66,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 279.9840087890625
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 280.1440124511719,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        100,
        101,
        102,
        103
      ],
      "characterBudget": 115,
      "text": "But there’s something important to watch for: if this movement makes your back pain,",
      "id": 67,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        74
      ],
      "end": 288.5058073337307
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 288.56253768724065,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        100,
        101,
        102,
        103
      ],
      "characterBudget": 98,
      "text": "numbness, or tingling worse, it may not be right for you, so stop for now.",
      "id": 68,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 295.66400146484375
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 295.66400146484375,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        104
      ],
      "characterBudget": 66,
      "text": "After rocking for a while, your spine can gradually realign from side to side.",
      "id": 69,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 300.22400587320965
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 300.2592989687979,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        104
      ],
      "characterBudget": 15,
      "text": "It’s that simple.",
      "id": 70,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 301.1839904785156
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "start": 301.343994140625,
      "overBudget": true,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "hard",
      "sourceIDs": [
        105
      ],
      "characterBudget": 29,
      "text": "Thank you, Dr. Wu, for that wonderful demonstration.",
      "id": 71,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 303.42401123046875
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "start": 303.66400146484375,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        106,
        107,
        108,
        109,
        110
      ],
      "characterBudget": 111,
      "text": "To prevent scoliosis from worsening, what should patients pay attention to in daily life,",
      "id": 72,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        75
      ],
      "end": 311.249526017133
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "start": 311.3004391810405,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        106,
        107,
        108,
        109,
        110
      ],
      "characterBudget": 46,
      "text": "when lying down, sitting, or resting?",
      "id": 73,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 314.48694110208
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "start": 314.53785426598745,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        106,
        107,
        108,
        109,
        110
      ],
      "characterBudget": 41,
      "text": "Could you share some tips, Dr. Wu?",
      "id": 74,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 317.68400146484373
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 318.4639892578125,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "hard",
      "sourceIDs": [
        111,
        112
      ],
      "characterBudget": 31,
      "text": "First, maintain good posture.",
      "id": 75,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 320.5358556778828
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 320.57763369166906,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        111,
        112
      ],
      "characterBudget": 13,
      "text": "Actually...",
      "id": 76,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 321.2879333496094
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 321.2879333496094,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        113,
        114
      ],
      "characterBudget": 84,
      "text": "Scoliosis isn’t always caused by poor posture.",
      "id": 77,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 327.14794921875
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 327.30792236328125,
      "overBudget": true,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        115
      ],
      "characterBudget": 1,
      "text": "Mm.",
      "id": 78,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 327.4679260253906
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 327.6279296875,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        116,
        117
      ],
      "characterBudget": 64,
      "text": "It’s strange—it can progress very quickly during puberty.",
      "id": 79,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 332.0279235839844
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 332.0279235839844,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        118,
        119
      ],
      "characterBudget": 122,
      "text": "Even without poor posture, good posture can help prevent scoliosis from worsening.",
      "id": 80,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        72
      ],
      "end": 340.7479248046875
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 340.7479248046875,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        120
      ],
      "characterBudget": 35,
      "text": "So that’s something to keep in mind.",
      "id": 81,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 343.30792236328125
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 343.30792236328125,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        121,
        122,
        123,
        124
      ],
      "characterBudget": 53,
      "text": "Also, don’t stay in one position for a long time.",
      "id": 82,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 347.0353122642742
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 347.08179639292155,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        121,
        122,
        123,
        124
      ],
      "characterBudget": 100,
      "text": "Even with good posture, people with scoliosis can get uncomfortable if they sit too long.",
      "id": 83,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        71
      ],
      "end": 354.1279406738281
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 354.1079406738281,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        125,
        126,
        127
      ],
      "characterBudget": 43,
      "text": "Since their posture is already affected,",
      "id": 84,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 356.9851287644229
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 357.028715559512,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        125,
        126,
        127
      ],
      "characterBudget": 85,
      "text": "they should get up and move around or stretch regularly if they sit for a long time.",
      "id": 85,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        74
      ],
      "end": 363.14794921875
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 363.14794921875,
      "overBudget": true,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        128
      ],
      "characterBudget": 42,
      "text": "Also, watch your sleep position; try not to sleep on your stomach.",
      "id": 86,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 366.2012634277344
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 366.2012634277344,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        129
      ],
      "characterBudget": 47,
      "text": "Sleeping on your stomach puts pressure on your neck.",
      "id": 87,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 369.7506103515625
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 369.7506103515625,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        130,
        131
      ],
      "characterBudget": 113,
      "text": "Your chest may also cave downward, which can cause problems and affect your spine.",
      "id": 88,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        71
      ],
      "end": 378.28570556640625
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 378.28570556640625,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        132
      ],
      "characterBudget": 45,
      "text": "Also, avoid carrying heavy loads.",
      "id": 89,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 381.4079284667969
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 381.4079284667969,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        133,
        134
      ],
      "characterBudget": 62,
      "text": "Carrying heavy things puts strain on your body, so be careful.",
      "id": 90,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 385.8679504394531
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 385.8679504394531,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        135,
        136,
        137
      ],
      "characterBudget": 71,
      "text": "You may need to avoid certain activities, like long-distance running,",
      "id": 91,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 390.6816525882223
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 390.72307721802645,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        135,
        136,
        137
      ],
      "characterBudget": 50,
      "text": "ballet, rhythmic gymnastics, and even swimming.",
      "id": 92,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 394.2279357910156
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 394.2279357910156,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        138,
        139
      ],
      "characterBudget": 86,
      "text": "But isn’t swimming symmetrical and therefore helpful for spinal balance?",
      "id": 93,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 400.18792724609375
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 400.18792724609375,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        140,
        141,
        142
      ],
      "characterBudget": 126,
      "text": "Although swimming is symmetrical, with strokes like freestyle and breaststroke,",
      "id": 94,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        66
      ],
      "end": 408.7883048208002
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 408.850981599365,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        140,
        141,
        142,
        143,
        144,
        145,
        146,
        147,
        148
      ],
      "characterBudget": 128,
      "text": "people with scoliosis......may use one side more because their strength is uneven.",
      "id": 95,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        75
      ],
      "end": 417.63462962759553
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 417.69745945834825,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        143,
        144,
        145,
        146,
        147,
        148
      ],
      "characterBudget": 137,
      "text": "This can create muscle imbalances and may actually worsen their scoliosis, so be careful.",
      "id": 96,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        64
      ],
      "end": 427.387939453125
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 427.387939453125,
      "overBudget": true,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        149
      ],
      "characterBudget": 53,
      "text": "Lastly, change your diet and make sure you get enough nutrients.",
      "id": 97,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 431.2679443359375
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 431.2679443359375,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        150,
        151,
        152,
        153,
        154,
        155
      ],
      "characterBudget": 94,
      "text": "Studies show that people who are underweight are more likely to have low bone density,",
      "id": 98,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        73
      ],
      "end": 438.1550850535649
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 438.20057454325496,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        150,
        151,
        152,
        153,
        154,
        155
      ],
      "characterBudget": 40,
      "text": "which is associated with scoliosis.",
      "id": 99,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 440.9030019949127
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 440.94849148460276,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        150,
        151,
        152,
        153,
        154,
        155
      ],
      "characterBudget": 95,
      "text": "Among women with scoliosis, 27 to 38 percent have low bone density throughout the body.",
      "id": 100,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        67
      ],
      "end": 448.06244007964796
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 448.107929569338,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        150,
        151,
        152,
        153,
        154,
        155
      ],
      "characterBudget": 81,
      "text": "For those with more severe curves, that figure may be as high as 47 percent.",
      "id": 101,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        68
      ],
      "end": 454.06793212890625
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "start": 454.06793212890625,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        156,
        157
      ],
      "characterBudget": 70,
      "text": "Dr. Wu, your advice on scoliosis today has been fascinating and very practical.",
      "id": 102,
      "displayLineBreaks": [
        69
      ],
      "end": 459.0399938383483
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 1",
      "start": 459.07676552313814,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        156,
        157
      ],
      "characterBudget": 29,
      "text": "Could you briefly sum it up for us?",
      "id": 103,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 461.2679443359375
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 462.59197998046875,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "hard",
      "sourceIDs": [
        158
      ],
      "characterBudget": 7,
      "text": "Sure.",
      "id": 104,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 463.0719909667969
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 463.23199462890625,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        159
      ],
      "characterBudget": 45,
      "text": "Scoliosis can be quite difficult to treat.",
      "id": 105,
      "displayLineBreaks": [],
      "end": 466.11199951171875
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Speaker 2",
      "start": 466.1919860839844,
      "overBudget": false,
      "timingQuality": "estimated",
      "boundaryBefore": "none",
      "sourceIDs": [
        160,
        161,
        162,
        163,
        164
